
### 1. CREATE - Add a movie
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "category": "Sci-Fi",
  "year": 2010
}

###

### 2. READ - Get all movies
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/movies

###

### 3. READ - Get movie by ID
### Replace YOUR_MOVIE_ID with actual _id from POST response
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/movies/6afc18872168da8d19a726ae

###

### 4. UPDATE - Update movie by ID
### Replace YOUR_MOVIE_ID with actual _id
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/movies/6afc18872168da8d19a726ae
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Interstellar",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "category": "Science Fiction",
  "year": 2014
}

###

### 5. DELETE - Delete movie by ID
### Replace YOUR_MOVIE_ID with actual _id
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/movies/6afc18872168da8d19a726ae
